{"id":"74261e48e94a4d06","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model.md","title":"ZFC Inner Derived Model","display":"df-zfc-inner-derived-model — ZFC Inner Derived Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-derived-model — ZFC Inner Derived Model","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-derived-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-derived-model — ZFC Inner Derived Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"164488c69fed4a7f\" href=\"?note=164488c69fed4a7f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal.md\">58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" href=\"?note=bafc4b7d4da7f0a7\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-dense.md\">../batch10/58-df-dense.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous.md\">58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in V\">\\(\\delta\\in V\\)</span> (limit of Woodin cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*\">\\(\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*\\)</span> (collapse datum, external generic, derived reals, and derived pointclass)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (the derived inner-model class in the collapse extension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VGeneric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VGeneric}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyComplementingBelow}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsolutelyComplementingBelow}_S\\)</span> (schemas defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p[T]\">\\(p[T]\\)</span> (projection of a tree on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\times\\delta\">\\(\\omega\\times\\delta\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V[H]=\\{\\operatorname{val}_H(\\tau):\\tau\\text{ is a ground-model forcing name}\\}\">\\(V[H]=\\{\\operatorname{val}_H(\\tau):\\tau\\text{ is a ground-model forcing name}\\}\\)</span> (the standard external generic-extension class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)^{V[G]}\">\\(L(\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)^{V[G]}\\)</span> (the relativized constructible class computed in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V[G]\">\\(V[G]\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span> (see the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_Q\\Vdash_{V,\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle}\\varphi\">\\(1_Q\\Vdash_{V,\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle}\\varphi\\)</span> (the definable forcing-relation schema over the ambient universe)</li>\n<li>All occurrences of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V[H]\">\\(V[H]\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>-genericity, and relativized constructibility are interpreted in the external class metatheory</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S\\)</span> (class-schema predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}levy\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}below}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S(\\mathbb P,\\delta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P_\\delta,\\leq_\\delta\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nP_\\delta=\n\\Bigl\\{p\\in V:\\exists d\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(d)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,d,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\n\\forall\\langle n,\\alpha\\rangle\\in d\\;\np(\\langle n,\\alpha\\rangle)\\in\\alpha\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\leq_\\delta=\n\\{\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in P_\\delta\\times P_\\delta:p\\subseteq q\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P=\\langle P_\\delta,\\leq_\\delta\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(P_\\delta,\\leq_\\delta,\\varnothing)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}levy\\text{-}collapse\\text{-}below}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S(\\mathbb P,\\delta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P_\\delta,\\leq_\\delta\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nP_\\delta=\n\\Bigl\\{p\\in V:\\exists d\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Finite}(d)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,d,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{48mm}\\land\n\\forall\\langle n,\\alpha\\rangle\\in d\\;\np(\\langle n,\\alpha\\rangle)\\in\\alpha\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\leq_\\delta=\n\\{\\langle q,p\\rangle\\in P_\\delta\\times P_\\delta:p\\subseteq q\\}\n\\land\\mathbb P=\\langle P_\\delta,\\leq_\\delta\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(P_\\delta,\\leq_\\delta,\\varnothing)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}ambient\\text{-}generic}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VGeneric}_S(G,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\n\\forall D\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}ambient\\text{-}generic}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VGeneric}_S(G,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\n\\forall D\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}tree\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S(T,\\eta)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq(\\omega\\times\\eta)^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega\\times\\eta)\n\\land\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)+1\\;\n(s\\upharpoonright m\\in T)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}tree\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S(T,\\eta)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq(\\omega\\times\\eta)^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,\\omega\\times\\eta)\n\\land\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(s)+1\\;\n(s\\upharpoonright m\\in T)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}complementing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{AbsolutelyComplementingBelow}_S(T,S,\\delta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S(T,\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S(S,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q,\\leq_Q,1_Q\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(Q,\\leq_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land Q\\approx\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\to\n1_Q\\Vdash_{V,\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle}\n\\ulcorner p[\\check T]=\\mathbb R\\setminus p[\\check S]\\urcorner\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}complementing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{AbsolutelyComplementingBelow}_S(T,S,\\delta)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S(T,\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{TreeCode}_S(S,\\delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q,\\leq_Q,1_Q\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(Q,\\leq_Q,1_Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\n\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land Q\\approx\\kappa\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\to\n1_Q\\Vdash_{V,\\langle Q,\\leq_Q\\rangle}\n\\ulcorner p[\\check T]=\\mathbb R\\setminus p[\\check S]\\urcorner\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}derived\\text{-}model}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S\n(D,\\delta,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{Woodin}(\\kappa)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S(\\mathbb P,\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{VGeneric}_S(G,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb R^*=\n\\Bigl\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\delta\\;\\exists P_\\xi,\\leq_\\xi,\\mathbb P_\\xi\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S(\\mathbb P_\\xi,\\xi)\n\\land\\mathbb P_\\xi=\\langle P_\\xi,\\leq_\\xi\\rangle\n\\land x\\in V[G\\cap P_\\xi]\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Gamma^*=\n\\Bigl\\{p[T]^{V[G]}\\cap\\mathbb R^*:\nT\\in V\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AbsolutelyComplementingBelow}_S(T,S,\\delta)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land D=L(\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)^{V[G]}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}derived\\text{-}model}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcInnerDerivedModel}_S\n(D,\\delta,\\mathbb P,G,\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\bigl(\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{Woodin}(\\kappa)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S(\\mathbb P,\\delta)\n\\land\\mathrm{VGeneric}_S(G,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbb R^*=\n\\Bigl\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\n\\exists\\xi\\in\\delta\\;\\exists P_\\xi,\\leq_\\xi,\\mathbb P_\\xi\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LevyCollapseBelow}_S(\\mathbb P_\\xi,\\xi)\n\\land\\mathbb P_\\xi=\\langle P_\\xi,\\leq_\\xi\\rangle\n\\land x\\in V[G\\cap P_\\xi]\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Gamma^*=\n\\Bigl\\{p[T]^{V[G]}\\cap\\mathbb R^*:\nT\\in V\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AbsolutelyComplementingBelow}_S(T,S,\\delta)\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land D=L(\\mathbb R^*,\\Gamma^*)^{V[G]}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The collapse order is an explicit set forcing, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is generic only in the external class metatheory; the impossible object-level call “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>-generic inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>” has been removed.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^*\">\\(\\Gamma^*\\)</span> is generated by tree pairs whose projections remain complementary after every forcing of cardinality below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>, a standard code for the derived universally Baire pointclass.</li>\n<li>The derived model is the relativized constructible class in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V[G]\">\\(V[G]\\)</span>, not a set quotient of the ground universe.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"164488c69fed4a7f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"bafc4b7d4da7f0a7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-filter-on-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-dense.md","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-dense.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","loc